# REPRODUCTION for bead inc-akac: a summoned frost giant (lib/mon2.irh:2450,
# ABILITY(CA_FEED_UPON_PAIN,6)) is a level-6 source of Feed upon Pain. Its
# attacks land on the player while the player just waits, read with
# tools/check_feed_upon_pain.sh via logs/pain.log (INCURSION_PAIN_PROBE=1).
# Any character works as the punching bag; the rogue chargen is the
# shortest one already proven reliable
# (tools/keys/sneak-invis-chargen.keys, bead inc-nkf2). Cheat Death (Wizard
# Mode Switches row 1, same as tools/keys/sneak-invis-melee.keys) keeps a
# killing blow from ending the session before enough strikes land.

@include sneak-invis-chargen.keys

SPACE   # dismiss the arrival-room description

w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
SPACE
ESC

w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Giants"
@choose "frost giant"
RIGHT RIGHT ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC
@dump:victim

s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t01
s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t02
s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t03
s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t04
s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t05
s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t06
s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t07
s
@while "stop searching" y
@while "Die?" n
@dump:t08

@quit
